token-in-path.sxcu: the address holds what looks like a token in its path: not supported in v1
http-with-secret.sxcu: the profile uses secrets: its address must be https://
old-version.sxcu: Version 12.3.1 and below are not supported (ShareX refuses them too)
url-shortener.sxcu: DestinationType URLShortener is out of scope in v1
unknown-field.sxcu: unsupported field(s): RegexList, Surprise
xml-function.sxcu: response.url: {xml} is not supported by Kropa (docs/uploads.md section 2.4)
userinfo.sxcu: RequestURL: user:password@ is refused
